<title>UK: GUS deputy chairman Pugh to retire.</title>
<headline>GUS deputy chairman Pugh to retire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK retailer Great Universal Stores said on Friday that deputy chairman Richard Pugh would retire from the board on September 27.</p>
<p>The company said it would appoint Eric Barnes and Victor Blank to become deputy chairman on that day.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
